1
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:11,720
I asked you what you dream of

2
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:15,940
You didn't say a word

3
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:20,260
Now I walk the way you walked

4
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:23,900
And hear what you have heard

5
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:27,780
There's a beat inside your hands

6
00:00:27,780 --> 00:00:31,680
You never let me hear

7
00:00:31,680 --> 00:00:34,940
Every light you left on

8
00:00:34,940 --> 00:00:39,620
Is leading me to you

9
00:00:39,620 --> 00:00:43,600
Three steps behind you

10
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:46,000
I'm counting too

11
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:49,720
One, two, three, and four

12
00:00:49,720 --> 00:00:51,780
Now I know what it's for

13
00:00:51,780 --> 00:00:54,560
If you're counting to four

14
00:00:54,560 --> 00:00:58,560
Let me count with you
